OL,3,CTemperatures set to rise on Sunday as
OL,4,CUK braces for next heatwave
OL,6,FTemperatures are expected to reach up
OL,7,Fto 33C in parts of the UK on Sunday as
OL,8,Fthe country braces for another
OL,9,Fheatwave over the coming week.
OL,11,FYellow heat health alerts came into
OL,12,Fforce at 9am on Saturday as
OL,13,Ftemperatures rose throughout the day,
OL,14,Freaching up to 28C in the South and
OL,15,FSouth East, and up to 27C across most
OL,16,Fof central England.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
