OL,3,CTemperatures set to rise on Sunday as
OL,4,CUK braces for next heatwave
OL,6,FAny wildfires are likely to be
OL,7,Fexceptionally severe on Sunday in
OL,8,Falmost all of the east and south-east
OL,9,Fof England, according to the Fire
OL,10,FSeverity Index. "Exceptional" severity
OL,11,Fis its highest ranking.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
