OL,3,CTemperatures set to rise on Sunday as
OL,4,CUK braces for next heatwave
OL,6,FThe National Trust is asking people to
OL,7,Fsign a petition calling on the
OL,8,FGovernment to make tackling climate
OL,9,Fchange a national mission.
OL,11,FIt comes after several wildfires broke
OL,12,Fout in the UK over recent weeks, with
OL,13,Flarge blazes at Dunwich Heath in
OL,14,FSuffolk, Headon Warren on the Isle of
OL,15,FWight, Llanwonno in the Rhondda
OL,16,FValleys, South Wales, and the
OL,17,FCairngorms National Park in Scotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
